          deckDescription: 'A stripped French deck containing 32 cards with four suits (Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades) and eight ranks per suit (7 through Ace), created by removing all 2s through 6s from a standard 52-card deck.',
          suitDescription: 'Four traditional French suits: Hearts (Cœur), Diamonds (Carreau), Clubs (Trèfle), and Spades (Pique), each represented with standard French card iconography and distinct color coding for easy recognition during gameplay.',
          rankDescription: 'Eight ranks per suit in ascending order: 7, 8, 9, 10, Jack (Valet), Queen (Dame), King (Roi), and Ace as the highest card, where each rank determines card strength and eligibility for building sequences in this shedding game.',
