        prompts: {
          human: "No trumpsâ€”highest card of the suit led wins. Follow suit. Collect points: Aces 1 each, face cards and 10-9 a third each. Hold all four 7s? You win the game. Win three tricks in a row with 10-9-Ace of a suit? That's La Politaineâ€”11 extra points. First to 31 wins.",
          ai: 'Game: Quatre Sept. Progression: [Deal -> Check four 7s (instant win) -> Play(8 tricks) -> Score hand]. No trumps. 32 cards, rank 10-9-A-K-Q-J-8-7. Follow suit. A=1, 10/9/K/Q/J=1/3, last trick=1. La Politaine: 10-9-A, announce before first, win 3 consecutive tricks = 11 bonus. Game to 31.',
        },
        scoring: {
          description: 'Point-trick scoring. Aces 1 each; 10, 9, K, Q, J 1/3 each; 8 and 7 no value; last trick 1. La Politaine bonus 11. Total 11 points per hand (fractions ignored).',
